{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"よう(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほぼ昨日書いた記事だ、すまん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近また忘れ物多すぎて\n困ってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもどこに忘れたか全く記憶にない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、やばい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからセンターわけでいくの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nセンターわけするつもりはないよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこれから中山競馬場！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち位置ね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下手が多いよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう遅いかな(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど\nどこでも見れるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/05/26/2727958/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\n自然にあふれてるところでの\n撮影が多かったからか\n花粉症再発したぽ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あああっと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日だけど\nなあちゃん誕生日おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}